      "name": "Akshay",
      "created_at": "2025-08-14T09:46:18.801Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You need to cancel the existing quotation and amend it.<br>\nUsing Amend, you can identify your actual record and revised record. There is no option to modify the same quotation after submission.</p>",
